[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576396461","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101249#issuecomment-2576396461","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101249","id":2576396461,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZkLCt","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T23:06:29Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T23:06:29Z","body":"> Going through and changing color logic again made for a good excuse to tweak how the GDExtension `SConstruct` files are handled; they'll now call to the root `methods.py` instead of using their own variants, consolidating overall code.\r\n\r\nModules (and GDExtension versions of modules even more so) are meant to be self-contained. A godot-cpp GDExtension shouldn't depend on a file in the main Godot repo, it should only use godot-cpp.\r\n\r\nIf color is too much hassle for this, I'd suggest just removing color there.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576396461/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576405803","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101249#issuecomment-2576405803","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101249","id":2576405803,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZkNUr","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T23:14:46Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T23:14:46Z","body":"> A godot-cpp GDExtension shouldn't depend on a file in the main Godot repo, it should only use godot-cpp.\r\n\r\nIn isolation I'd agree, but these GDExtensions are already very much integrated in the repo itself. Seeing as they're already using relative path includes for building, I see no reason to not have the same functionality here.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576405803/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576416480","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101249#issuecomment-2576416480","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101249","id":2576416480,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZkP7g","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T23:25:57Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T23:27:02Z","body":"> > A godot-cpp GDExtension shouldn't depend on a file in the main Godot repo, it should only use godot-cpp.\r\n> \r\n> In isolation I'd agree, but these GDExtensions are already very much integrated in the repo itself. Seeing as they're already using relative path includes for building, I see no reason to not have the same functionality here.\r\n\r\nI disagree. It was a mistake to couple them to outside functionality (they're not in `4.3`, where they use their own `methods.py`), and this should be reverted. One overzealous refactoring leads to multiple hacks to support a change that's not needed in the first place. The main reason for these GDExtensions to exist is to serve as an example of how a C++ module can be cross-compiled to an extension from the same codebase.\r\n\r\nLike modules, extensions are meant to be self-contained, can be moved around, including out of tree, and should still work fine. I'm not sure the current implementation even in 4.3 fully satisfies this design principle, but it's not a reason to make it worse for cosmetic reasons.\r\n\r\nI already flagged in a previous PR how the relative includes of main repo functionality was a big code smell.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576416480/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576438110","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101249#issuecomment-2576438110","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101249","id":2576438110,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZkVNe","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T23:48:30Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T23:48:30Z","body":"If that was always the intent, then I have no further objections. Reverted the changes here & from that prior PR to make them completely isolated from the rest of the repo.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576438110/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2577880622","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101249#issuecomment-2577880622","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101249","id":2577880622,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zp1Yu","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T14:58:29Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T14:58:29Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2577880622/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2945371302","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101249#issuecomment-2945371302","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101249","id":2945371302,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vjsym","user":{"login":"shana","id":310137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDEzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/310137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana","html_url":"https://github.com/shana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T17:23:58Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T17:23:58Z","body":"I'm guessing this wasn't tested with VS builds? This is the output when building in VS:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c74e488d-5b47-47fe-9eab-8e6ab9d53a31)\r\n\r\nIs there a flag to disable colors that can be passed to scons?\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2945371302/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_git